he inferred register file uses BSRAM. A scratch banked-flop file\\nalone reduced median Fmax to 55.748 MHz because register-number\\ncomparison through forwarding became critical. Registering dependency\\nmatches and using parallel operand selection with the original file\\ninstead reached 60.173 MHz, but its 4.57 percent gain falls just short\\nof the 4.6 percent acceptance margin. Both paths therefore need the same\\nstructural treatment of operand delivery at the decode/execute boundary.\\n\n…[22107 of 25179 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b7ae0e54ad725d91]…\narry and alignment cases with immediate EX/WB\\nconsumers. Check retained-WB forwarding through dmem/M holds,\\nexact RVFI results and once-only memory effects in both modes.\\nCheck that retained invalid EX payloads cannot forward, write\\nregisters or issue memory requests during bubbles and M waits.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 173.35, \"delta_pct\": -0.12, \"vs_baseline\": 1330.28, \"fmax_mhz\": 69.992, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4037538, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5143, \"ff\": 1923, \"seeds\": [71.681, 69.992, 69.992], \"perturbations\": [[0, 71.681, 17], [1, 69.992, 15], [2, 69.992, 15]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_div/quotient_30_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_div/remainder_15_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -8.951, \"arrival_ns\": 19.245, \"logic_cells\": 60, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_div\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 17, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T09:39:19.033478Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 8}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
