tural attempts\\nor LESSONS.md. Removing this deep arithmetic path is more promising than\\nimproving instruction throughput while keeping the same clock limit.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Introduce one shared, blocking multicycle DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU unit in EX.\\nUse unsigned restoring division, computing eight quotient bits per cycle\\nwith\n…[29829 of 32901 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cd5e0ccbb7710cb0]…\n\": 749.26, \"fmax_mhz\": 46.231, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2818, \"ff\": 626, \"seeds\": [45.111, 46.231, 46.231], \"perturbations\": [[0, 45.111, 22], [1, 46.231, 23], [2, 46.231, 23]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_3_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -17.168, \"arrival_ns\": 27.462, \"logic_cells\": 37, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 22, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T04:41:59.588845Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 2, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-002-r2s1 (improvement, +50.15%): Folding two narrow restoring steps into launch and moving sign correction to EX/MEM acceptance lets `div_unit` shorten serial subtract/select chains from eight steps to five within the same eight-edge service schedule, improving fitness without adding divider latency.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
