{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261003-001-r13s0.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nd['title']='Select PC updates through exclusive redirect and fetch data lanes'\nh=d['hypothesis']; insert='''\n  In IF, flatten the remaining redirect-versus-fetch target mux into\n  three mutually exclusive word lanes. Define er=redirect && \"'!reset,\n  ed=fetch_accept && predict_taken, and el=fetch_accept && !predict_taken.\n  Form next_pc=(redirect_target & {32{er}}) |\n               (direct_target & {32{ed}}) |\n               ((pc+32'\"'d4) & {32{el}}).\n  Keep reset as the first PC-register priority; otherwise capture next_pc\n  when redirect || fetch_accept and retain PC on every other edge.\n  fetch_accept already excludes redirect and reset, so the three lanes\n  are exclusive. Preserve fetch_accept, occupancy, queue payload updates,\n  predictor lookup/training and all other IF equations exactly. This and\n  EX's saved-prediction substitution optimize one PC destination-selection\n  cone. Keep EX's replay/target ternary; do not expand it into another\n  masked-OR network, which regressed in a scratch trial.\n\n'''\nh=h.replace('Keep consumer replay',insert.strip()+'\\\\n\\\\nKeep consumer replay')\nh += '''\nA scratch prototype of this exact EX substitution and three-lane IF\nselection measured 73.689 MHz in vendor placement option 1, using 5,418\nLUT4, 1,929 registers, four BSRAMs and two DSPs. This is slightly BELOW\nthe champion and below the acceptance threshold, not a demonstrated gain.\nThe simpler EX-only precursor reached 73.283 MHz and passed the existing\nreal/ALTOPS pipeline suites, all eight selftest/random reference-ISS\ncomparisons with and without bus stalls, and canonical CoreMark at\n4,037,538 bracket cycles. That correctness evidence applies only to the\nprecursor. Extra EX target flattening, comparator rewrites, broad result\npredecode and a separate address register were slower and are excluded.\nThe five-percent estimate is a low-confidence goal for final physical\nmapping; the measured prototype does not establish it. Full prescribed\nmedian timing and unchanged correctness gates remain mandatory.\n'''\nd['hypothesis']=h\nd['changes'].insert(1,{'file':'rtl/if_stage.sv','description':'Replace the priority mux between correction, predicted direct fetch and sequential fetch destinations with the three exclusive masked-OR lanes specified in the hypothesis. Preserve reset priority, PC hold, original fetch_accept, queue state and predictor semantics.'})\nd['changes'].append({'file':'test/test_if_stage.py','description':'Retain the existing fetch/predictor/queue suite. Add PC-selection equivalence coverage across reset, redirect, full queue, imem readiness and direct prediction, checking exact PC holds, redirects during unready buses and coherent queue tokens.'})\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=90))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Updated schema-valid hypothesis')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
