e partial\\nremainder and quotient between groups. Four recurrence cycles replace\\nthe current 32-step combinational operation. Capture forwarded operands\\nonce, prepare magnitudes for signed operations, and register final sign\\ncorrection separately. Bound the schedule to eight EX service cycles:\\ncapture, magnitude prepar\n…[133377 of 136449 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:68efb632c57b7904]…\nged by later training, misaligned taken and\\nuntaken targets, reserved branch encodings, cancellation replay,\\nbus holds and reset. Assert exact RVFI operands, traps, next PC,\\ncontiguous order and absence of wrong-path memory effects. Retain\\nall existing progress and branch-to-divider latency assertions.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 180.63, \"delta_pct\": -1.27, \"vs_baseline\": 1390.35, \"fmax_mhz\": 72.932, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4037538, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5429, \"ff\": 1933, \"seeds\": [59.923, 72.932, 72.932], \"perturbations\": [[0, 59.923, 12], [1, 72.932, 17], [2, 72.932, 17]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_fwd/fwd_rs1_1_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_fwd/fwd_rs1_3_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -11.688, \"arrival_ns\": 21.982, \"logic_cells\": 28, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T10:24:27.681385Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 9}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
