{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_4", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n 'structural|r11s1|r13s1|r7s1' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\"", "aggregated_output": "3:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261003-002-r1s1\", \"title\": \"Replace combinational division with a bounded multicycle execute unit\", \"category\": \"structural\", \"motivation\": \"The baseline scores 12.12 iterations/s at a median 5.442 MHz. Its reported\\nworst path traverses forwarding and the execute ALU, with 156 cells and\\n199.837 ns arrival time. The ALU currently contains combinational signed\\nand unsigned division and remainder operators, making a fully unrolled\\ndivider the leading explanation for this extreme depth. Such hardware\\nconstrains the clock even when executing other instructions. The local\\nhistory contains only the baseline and has no prior structural attempts\\nor LESSONS.md. Removing this deep arithmetic path is more promising than\\nimproving instruction throughput while keeping the same clock limit.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The baseline scores 12.12 iterations/s at a median 5.442 MHz. Its reported\\nworst path traverses forwarding and the execute ALU, with 156 cells and\\n199.837 ns arrival time. The ALU currently contains combinational signed\\nand unsigned division and remainder operators, making a fully unrolled\\ndivider the leading explanation for this extreme depth. Such hardware\\nconstrains the clock even when executing other instructions. The local\\nhistory contains only the baseline and has no prior structural attempts\\nor LESSONS.md. Removing this deep arithmetic path is more promising than\\nimproving instruction throughput while keeping the same clock limit.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Introduce one shared, blocking multicycle DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU unit in EX.\\nUse unsigned restoring division, computing eight quotient bits per cycle\\nwith eight bounded subtract/select steps and registering the partial\\nremainder and quotient between groups. Four recurrence cycles replace\\nthe current 32-step combinational operation. Capture forwarded operands\\nonce, prepare magnitudes for signed operations, and register final sign\\ncorrection separately. Bound the schedule to eight EX service cycles:\\ncapture, magnitude prepar\n…[179308 of 182380 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:edd362f67b3e3320]…\nstruction-bus stalls, simultaneous training and buffered branches,\\nwrong-path stores/M operations, and canceled-source replay with a full\\nqueue. Preserve exact RVFI results/order/PC and all existing arithmetic\\nservice-time and bounded-progress assertions in real and ALTOPS modes.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 178.61, \"delta_pct\": -2.38, \"vs_baseline\": 1373.68, \"fmax_mhz\": 71.235, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3988311, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5696, \"ff\": 2321, \"seeds\": [72.664, 71.235, 71.235], \"perturbations\": [[0, 72.664, 12], [1, 71.235, 13], [2, 71.235, 13]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.read_data_25_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -8.762, \"arrival_ns\": 19.057, \"logic_cells\": 12, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T14:12:56.887243Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 13}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
