{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"The refined candidate registers recovery, then feeds the saved target directly to fetch during the recovery cycle. On a ready instruction bus, this lets the target enter decode while the younger wrong-path instruction is killed, potentially avoiding the extra recovery cycle that hurt the earlier attempt."}}
