{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_56","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261003-002-r7s1.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nd['hypothesis']=d['hypothesis'].replace('Prototype data\\\\nfor the individual changes motivates the combined hypothesis; it is\\\\nnot yet a measurement of the combined design.\\\\n','''A scratch prototype of the combined design used the unchanged FPGA\nwrapper, stall generator, constraints and vendor flow. Gowin placement\noptions 0/1/2 measured 62.665/64.003/64.003 MHz, median 64.003 MHz.\nIt used 5,213 LUT4, 1,924 FF, zero LUT-RAM, four BSRAM and two DSPs,\ncompared with the champion's 3,979 LUT4, 989 FF, eight LUT-RAM, six\nBSRAM and two DSPs. The worst option-0 path moved from the register-file\nBSRAM output to WB result selection through EX, with arrival reduced\nfrom 23.828 ns to 21.253 ns. This is a changed storage and operand-route\nnetwork, not a circuit-neutral placement perturbation.\n\nThe prototype completed the canonical stalled ten-iteration CoreMark\nrun in exactly 4,037,538 bracket cycles; the unchanged validator accepted\nits CRCs and UART text and the harness reported no out-of-bounds access.\nThe resulting product is 158.51987 iterations/s, 11.2264 percent above\n142.52. Keep the forecast at 10 percent with medium confidence because\nimplementation details and placement can reduce this margin.\n\nThe prototype passes strict Verilator lint, all five existing register-file\ncocotb tests, all 30 existing pipeline tests in each of real and ALTOPS\nmodes, and selftest plus three random programs with complete reference-ISS\nRVFI comparison both with and without instruction/data stalls. Both\nexisting static checks for excluded combinational M hardware also pass.\nThe unchanged full formal suite is still running; these scratch results\ndo not replace the implementation phase's full correctness gates.\nDeliver only the hypothesis, leaving repository RTL unchanged.\n''')\nclass D(yaml.SafeDumper): pass\nD.add_representer(str,lambda dumper,s: dumper.represent_scalar('tag:yaml.org,2002:str',s,style='|' if '\\\\n' in s else None))\np.write_text(yaml.dump(d,Dumper=D,sort_keys=False,width=88))\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Updated and schema-validated hypothesis')\nPY\nrg -c 'DONE \\\\(PASS' formal/last_run-*.log\nrg -n 'DONE \\\\((FAIL|ERROR)|SUMMARY' formal/last_run-*.log | tail -8\ngit status --short\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
