 Run unchanged formal, real and ALTOPS pipeline tests, stalled RVFI cosimulation and the canonical CoreMark validator. No repository RTL is delivered during hypothesis generation; the hypothesis is the implementation request.'''\nd['expected_impact']={'fitness_delta_pct':6,'confidence':'low'}\nd['changes']=[\n {'file':'rtl/if_stage.sv','description':'Implement the 32-entry folded-PC direction memory with one fetch lookup and snapshot-derived training writes. Capture raw two-bit state in complete queue tokens and bypass output, preserve pre-edge semantics, and keep all direct-target, queue and correction logic unchanged. Reset every logical state to 01.'},\n {'file':'rtl/core_pkg.sv','description':'Add a two-bit predictor_state field to if_id_t and id_ex_t, separate from predicted_taken. Preserve architectural and downstream RVFI fields.'},\n {'file':'rtl/id_stage.sv','description':'Capture and hold the selected token counter snapshot with the complete ID/EX bundle using existing reset/flush/hold/bubble priorities.'},\n {'file':'rtl/ex_stage.sv','description':'Export the saved predictor_state with the existing exact once-per-advance branch training event; compute the matching folded PC index. Keep actual branch outcomes, correction timing, traps, forwarding replay and M schedules unchanged.'},\n {'file':'rtl/core.sv','description':'Wire the two-bit saved-state feedback from EX to IF without adding a training or recovery pipeline stage. Preserve all public ports and nret=1 retirement behavior.'},\n {'file':'test/test_if_stage.py','description':'Model snapshot-trained saturating updates independently. Cover all eight state/outcome transitions, endpoints, reset, every folded index, collisions, pre-edge same-index reads/writes, queue full/empty behavior, held tokens and correction invalidation. Verify exact PC/instruction/prediction/snapshot coherence.'},\n {'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'Exercise branches whose table entries change between fetch and EX, short repeated-PC loops, colliding PCs, load-dependent branches, both recovery directions, misaligned and illegal encodings, operand replay and simultaneous imem/dmem stalls. Adapt predictor scoreboards and packed offsets while retaining exact retirement, RVFI, trap, memory, squash, M-latency and progress checks.'}\n]\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=86))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('VALID',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "VALID cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261003-003-r13s2.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
